      "text": [
        {
          "id": "title",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "#4 · Neumann whole (paper-eightfold); Taylor core theorem field; Symbolon Dynamics",
          "title": "The shared archetypal return — source, mark, recognition",
          "italic": "The refraction is Argued, not a claim that Neumann interpreted the mechanism or that its makers embodied his sequence; X/x is Taylor's, and the psychic refraction enters after the relation is established.",
          "body": "",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.05,
          "width": 560,
          "size": 30,
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "body1",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "The Neumann whole grounds the shared source–mark–recognition relation in which this attunement image participates; the source house supplies the psychic account of emerging differentiation, and Frank's protected encounter develops the mark, its field and their renewed relation. The native field gives the independent language: parent −/−; 0/1; ?/!; −/+; X/x; AM/IS; ∞/dx; returning 1/0 — not eight machine components. The local",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 620,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left",
          "w": 520
        },
        {
          "id": "body2",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "pressure belongs to the last two movements: a dial gives an exact indication while the reader remains situated; the return preserves exactness while reopening the horizon. Symbolon Dynamics sources the image–interpreter–field recursion: an encounter with an instrument can reorganise what its reader asks of representation. The mechanism does not need a psyche for the symbolic operation to be alive in that alteration of relation.\n\nOccurrences: the made instrument as mark (#0–#1, #4); the reader's return (#2, #4); the unchanged heavens as condition (#0, #4).",
          "x": 0.6,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 505,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left"
        }
      ],
