      "text": [
        {
          "id": "title",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "#5→0 · Heidegger 1977 q003; 1966 releasement; A32; Bratton q029/q038; Movement 45 (withheld until here)",
          "title": "The instrument returns to making",
          "italic": "Standing note: the Antikythera image is withheld by the essay until §5→0 · #2 — its absence earlier is an active promise; here it returns as the late, technically bounded image the argument has earned.",
          "body": "",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.05,
          "width": 560,
          "size": 30,
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "body1",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "Heidegger's technē and poiēsis passages place craft within knowing and bringing-forth; his Diotima citation at Symposium 205b gives that route its text. The essay's pairing with Aristophanes' symbolon in the same banquet is its own Argued coordination: emission makes a determinate thing available; return keeps its relation to what exceeds it active. Taylor argues that retained source, disclosed measure, reversible coordination and the sovereign commons can give return an architectural body: the instrument must expose the terms under which its disclosure has force, and encountered resistance must be able",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 620,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left",
          "w": 520
        },
        {
          "id": "body2",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "to reach those terms. A32 receives its exact return — the moving mirror adds an instrument that can initiate disclosure of its own conditions before asking the human to conform; causal influence is its necessary middle, not the completed vocation. Bratton's brief poses common procedural grammar with divergent world-models; attunement answers with participants able to locate and contest a source, criterion or permission. A completed reading can end in use, in a renewed question, or in setting the instrument down; its fidelity survives all three when source and person remain available beyond the answer.\n\nOccurrences: the coordinating mechanism and judging reader (#0–#5→0); the heavens beyond the dial (#0, #5→0); the exposed terms as the constructive demand (#5→0).",
          "x": 0.6,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 505,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left"
        }
      ],
